---
title: Homemade Kahlua
cookTime: 1 Hour
source.name: Dave Hyder
tags: Alcohol
---

Boil @ground coffee{1%lb}(any kind) in @water{1.5%qt} for ~{20%minutes}.
Cool. 

Strain through cheesecloth to retain liquid.
Discard coffee grounds.

Bring @water{2%qt} and @sugar{7%cup}(7C = 3.5#) to a boil.
Reduce heat and simmer ~{40%minutes}.

Add reserved coffee and stir in thoroughly. Cool mixture.

Add @vanilla extract{1/4%cup} and @Everclear liquer{750%ml}.

Let sit in a cool dark place for ~{2%weeks}, if possible.
